{"schema_version":"1.9.2","id":"ALSA-2026:103817","published":"2026-11-26T00:00:00Z","modified":"2026-11-26T22:15:02.755218236Z","related":["CVE-2026-63916","CVE-2026-98741","CVE-2026-99236","CVE-2026-99362"],"upstream":["CVE-2026-63916","CVE-2026-98741","CVE-2026-99236","CVE-2026-99362"],"summary":"Critical: kernel security, bug fix, and enhancement update","details":"The kernel packages contain the Linux kernel, the core of any Linux operating system.  \n\nSecurity Fix(es):  \n\n  * kernel: HID: wacom: Fix OOB write in wacom_hid_set_device_mode() (CVE-2026-63916)\n  * kernel: ALSA: ua101: reject mismatched capture/playback packet sizes (CVE-2026-98741)\n  * kernel: kernel: privilege escalation via incomplete event filter expressions (CVE-2026-99236)\n  * kernel: kernel: Out-of-bounds write in nfsd via crafted SEQUENCE compound requests (CVE-2026-99362)\n\n\nBug Fix(es) and Enhancement(s):  \n\n  * kswapd0 loops in do_shrink_slab holding shrinker_rwsem after list_lru_count_one returns a negative nr_items as unsigned long, system hangs (JIRA:RHEL-300411)\n  * [AlmaLinux 8] vlan-tagged GSO packets are dropped in __dev_queue_xmit with SKB_DROP_REASON_SKB_BAD_GSO (JIRA:RHEL-307055)\n  * AlmaLinux 8 error in device recovery while iscsi is in use (JIRA:RHEL-307720)\n\n\nFor more details about the security issue(s), including the impact, a CVSS score, acknowledgments, and other related information, refer to the CVE page(s) listed in the References section.\n","affected":[{"package":{"name":"bpftool","ecosystem":"AlmaLinux:8","purl":"pkg:rpm/almalinux/bpftool"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"4.18.0-553.190.1.el8_10"}]}],"database_specific":{"source":"https://github.com/AlmaLinux/osv-database/blob/master/advisories/almalinux8/ALSA-2026:103817.json"}},{"package":{"name":"kernel","ecosystem":"AlmaLinux:8","purl":"pkg:rpm/almalinux/kernel"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"4.18.0-553.190.1.el8_10"}]}],"d